<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">Kolossa</book>
  <para style="h">Kolossa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kolossa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolossa</para>
  <para style="mt">Kolossa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pasian deidan a Jesu Khrist sawltah leh i unaupa uh Timothi in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kolossa khuo a um, Khrist a misiengthoute leh unau ginumte kungah; i Pa uh Pasian leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist a kipat hepina leh lungmuonna na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute a dinga thungen ngitngetin Pasian leh i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist Pa kungah kipahthu ka gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a na ginna u’leh, misiengthoute zousie tunga itna na nei dan uh ka zah nua lang kalsie un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van a noute dinga kinepna hing kikoipieh ziehin, tua kinepna thu khu khantanhoi thutah thu ah tumasang lai in na zata uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua khantanhoi khu leitung pumpi a ga-a, akhan zel mabangin, na zah ua, thutah a Pasian hepina na hing thei ni ua kipat in na lah uah ga-a pung zel in na kung uah ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua thutah pen ka suoh hipi deitah uh Epiphras, noute taanga Khrist nasem muonhuoi tah akipat a na theitah mabang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman Hagau a koute nang itdan uh zong ka kung uah ahing phuongdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamte ziehin na itna thu uh ka zah ni ua kipat in noute a dinga thungetpieh leh pilna leh Hagaulam theichienna zousie a, Ama deilam theina a na hing dimna ding uh, hing ngetpieh ka tawp sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachia Mangpa dinga hindan kilawm leh sil zousie a deihuoi a na gamtat ua, nna hoi chinteng a, gasuo a, tualeh Pasian theisiemna lam a na hing khanlet na ding u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asilbawltheina thupitah dungzui a kipahna toh kukalna leh thuohatna lam a hatna zousie a suhat a na um theina ding un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vah a misiengthoute goutankhawmpi dinga achinga hing bawlpa, Pa kungah kipahthu gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman miel silbawltheina a kipat in eite ahing hundoh a, A Tapa ittah gam ah ahing lutsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eiten Ama ah Asisan zal in tatdohna i mu hi, ikhelna uh ngaidamna ngei khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama pen mutheilou, Pasian kibahpi silsiem zousie lah a pieng masapen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama zieh a sil zousie siem ahi a, leitunga umte hiin vantung a umte hitaleh, mu thei leh mutheilou hitaleh, mangtoupha hiin, lalnate leh vaihawmnate leh thuneinate hitaleh, sil zousie Ama tungtawn a siem leh Ama-a dinga siem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sil zousie um masangin Ama a um a, Ama ah sil zousie a um khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khrist khu tahsa pumpi chipen hattuom lutang ahi, Aman bangkim a tungnunna aneitheina dingin silzousie kipatna bul ahia, mishite lah a kipat pieng masa pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama a bukimna a um khu Pa deilam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh a Kross sisan zal a, lemna bawl in, Ama mama in sil zousie Ama toh a kilem sah hi, Ama ngel ah leitunga sil umte leh van a sil umte zong akilemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Noute pen khatvei lai a na gitlouna nasepte zieh un na lungsim uah Pasian akipat mikhuol leh melma na hi uhi, hinanleh tuin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A shina zal in atahsa pumpi ah Ama toh noute ahing kilempi kiata hi, Ama mai a siengthou leh genbanglou leh phawhna ding bei a ahing dinsah theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ginna a na um ngitnget ua, kibulphuna nei a dettah a na um ua, khantanhoi kinepna na zah ua kipat a na pielmanglou u’leh, tua khantanhoi khu vannuoi a silsiem zousie kunga kigenzah ahi a, Kei Paul zong tami khantanhoi nasempa ka hing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin noute a dinga ka gimthuoh na ah ka kipah hi, Khrist in atahsa-a dinga athuohna kisam nalaite keima tahsa ah ka sunzom zel hi, tua tahsa khu hattuom ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasian thu subukim dingin, noute dinga ka kung a Pasian in kepna nasep ahing pieh dungzui in hattuom nasempa ka hing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua Pasian thu khu kumtawn leh akhang akhanga thuguh kiphuol ana hi a, hinanleh tuin vang Amisiengthoute kunga sulat ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua thuguh kiphuol thupina haudan bang ahiei chi, Pasian in Jentelte kunga theisah aut mawng ahi, tua thuguh kiphuolpen thupina ding kinepna nouma a um Khrist khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama Khrist ahi, kouten kagen uh, Khrist Jesu a michin pichinga ka dinsah theina dingun, pilna zousie zanga michin vauhil in ka zilsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tambang tupna in, keima a um Ama thahatna in Ama sep bangbangin theitawp suo a sem in ka pang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noute leh Laodisia khuo a umte leh tahsa a ka mel mu nailou tampite a dinga ka hapan dan na thei uh ka dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian leh Pa leh Khrist a thuguh khu theidoh dinga theisiemna kichientah hausatna lam a itna kiphankhawma aum ua, hamuong tah a aum theina dingun, alungtangte uh hanthawn ka ut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist ah pilna leh theina gou zousie phuol in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koiman kamsiem thu a noute ahing sol louna dingun, tam ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tahsain na kung uah um sih nanleng, hagau in na kung uah ka um hi; Kilemtah a na umdan u’leh Khrist ginna a na detdan uh muin ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuazieh in Khrist Jesu, Mangpa khu na pomtaah mabang un, Ama ah um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama a huiha leh lamtouin um unlen, ahing kihilna mabangin ginna a kipah tah a um in, kipahthu genna a dim in um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilvang un, tuachilouin mi koi ahiei in, Khrist thu banga kibulphu hilouin mihingte thugousie leh leitung thubulte bangzawin, leitung pilna leh solna hawmpi toh mi’n ahing manzou kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrist ah Pasian bukimna zousie tahsa nei in ahing um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Ama ah noute na bukimta uhi. Ama khu vaihawmna leh thuneina zousie lutang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ah noute pen, khut a tan hilou a, tahsa khelna sapum paikhie a, Khrist teptanna a teptan na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baptisma ah ama toh vuikhawm na hita ua, tualeh mishi lah a kipat a Ama kaithoupa Pasian nasep gintatna ziehin noute zong kaithou na hita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh noute, na khelnate u’leh, na tahsa ua teptanlouna zieh a shi na hi lai un, Pasian in Ama toh ahing suhingkhawmta a, na tatkhelna zousie uh ahing ngaidamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dan thu izui ding ua um, eite hingdou leh ei toh kikaal lam a khut a kigiel khu nawtmang in Kross dawn a kilbeh in alamangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman vaihawmnate leh thuneinate susiein kross ah tuate zouin taangpi mu in alangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin neh leh dawn thu ahiei, pawi tungtang thu ahiei, hatha thu ahiei, ahisihleh khawlni thu ahiei ah koiman noute hing mawsah sih u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuate pen sil hing tungdingte him ahi, hinanleh atahtah khu Khrist ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi koima’n amaute bawlthu kingaingiemna dihlou leh vansawlsiengte bieh na pou kipahpi a mu theilou silte zanga ama pienken lungsim a kisang koi miin, na kipahman mu ding uh hing lahpieh sih heh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh lutang khu atudet sih ua, tahsa pen akizopna gu leh taangte leh thaguite zieh a, tua Lutang apat kivah leh kizomkhawm ahi a, Pasian akipat punna toh hing khangkhie ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin leitung thubulte apat Khrist toh shi na hitaah u’leh, bangdinga leitung dan a hing banga, dan thupieh nuoi a kitulut na hi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Sukha sin, chiem sin, thamsin, kichite,”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamte zousie pen akizah pum a mang sieng ding ahi, tamte bawl khu mihing thupieh leh thuhilna a zui ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tam silte khu akilat dan ah pil huoi bahna anei uh, hinanleh tam thuhilna amaute kibawlthu, biehna, kingaingiemna dihlou leh tahsa bangma a simlounate pen tahsa deilam suhpichinna lam ah bangma aphatuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachia Khrist toh kaithawkhawm na hitaah u’leh tunglam a Pasian zietlam a tou Khrist umna a sil umte sui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung a sil umte ah hilou in, tunglam a sil umte ah na lungsim uh nga un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na shita ua, na hinna uh Khrist toh Pasian ah phuol ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khrist, ihinna uh, ahing kilat chiengin noute zong Ama toh thupiin na kilang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin na tahsa hieng uh leitunga umte sulum un, huasannate, sienthoulounate, ki etlanate, utna giloute leh huoihamnate, huoihamna khu milim biehna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam silte ziehin, thu manglou tate tungah Pasian lungthahna hing tung ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tumasang lai in noute tua silte sunga na um lai un, amaute ah na hing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin vang tam silte zousie, lungthahna, thangpaina, ase lam kideisahna, kigensietna, ham giloute na kam ua pat koimang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khat leh khat kisoltuo sih un, mihing lui khu asilbawlte toh na koimangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing tha sil na hita uhi, tua mihing tha khu theina nei a Asiempa batpi a siemthain aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuanah Greekmi leh Judami, teptan leh teptanlou, nammawl leh Skithia mi leh sila leh noplen hitaleh kideidanna aum tuom sih a, Khrist khu bangkim a bangkim ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian mitel, misiengthou leh deitahte, bangin lainatna, nunnemna, kingaigiemna, lungnemna leh thuohhatnate sil un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khat leh khat kithuohpi tuo chiet unlen, kingaidam tuo chiet un, khat in khat tunga thubuoi na nei u’leh, Khrist in noute ahing ngaidam bangin, noute zong kingaidam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamte zousie tungah itna silthuo un, tua khu bukimna a kaankhawm ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian lungmuonna in na lungtang uah vaihawmsah un, tuabang hi dinga tahsa khat a hat zong na hi uhi, tualeh kipahna dan zong thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khrist thu khu a hausatna teng toh nouma ah umsah kingkeng un, pilna chintenga kizilsah leh kihil tuo a um in hepina lungtang nei in, Pasian kungah phatna late, Pasian late, Hagau lam late sain um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh na bawl pouma uh thugen lam hi in, nasep in hitaleh, abawnin Mangpa Jesu min in Ama zieh a, Pa Pasian kunga kipah thu gen kawm in bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zite aw, Mangpa ah akilawm hun bangin na pasalte uh kungah kitulut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasalte aw, na zite uh it unlen, atung uah gilou sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tate aw, sil zousie ah na nu leh pate uh thu mang un, tua khu Mangpa kipahna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pate aw, na tate uh lungthahsah sih un, tuachilouin alungke kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Suohte aw, sil zousie ah tahsa a na pute uh thu mangun, mihing lungkim sah sawm a mitmei veng bep hilou in, chitahna leh Pasian giing kawm in thu mangun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na bawl pouma uh mihingte tunga bawl bang hilou in, Mangpa tunga bawl bangin lunglut tahin bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mangpa kunga kipat in kipahman gouluoding na mu ding uhi chi thei un, aziehpen Mangpa Khrist nasem na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh sil dihlou bawl miin, asil dihlou bawlman amu kia ding hi, kideisahna tuom bangma a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pute aw, nouten zong van ah Pu na nei uh chi thei kawm in, na suohte uh tungah, adih leh akilawm hun khu bawl un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungluttah in thungen zingun, kipah thugen kawmin pilvang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang kaal ah, Pasian in koute thugenna ding kot ahing honpieh thei na ding leh Khrist thuguh kiphuol ka gendoh theina dingun Koute ding in zong thu hing nget pieh un, Khrist thuguh kiphuol zieha kolbun zong ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka gen ding banga ka gen thei na dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun lemtang leiin pulam mite lah ah pil tahin um un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Michin bangchi bang a dawn ding ahiei chi na thei na dingun na ham kamsuo uh hepina tel chi kisaw hi ngitnget heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tanchin zousie unaupa ittah Tikikus nasempa muonhuoi leh Mangpa a ka suoh hipipain, noute ahing theisah sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami ding ma a ama na kung ua ka hing sawl ahi, na tanchin uh athei a, tualeh na lungtang uh ahamuon sah thei na dingin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I unau muonhuoi leh ittah Onesimus na lah ua mi’n ama ahing zui hi. Amaun tamlanga sil umdan zousie ahing theisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka suongkul taanpi Aristarkus leh Barnaba sanggamnu tapa Mak in noute ahing nousiet hi, ama toh kisai thuhilna na muta uhi, ama na kung ua ahing pei chiengin na kipahpi un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Justus kichi Jesu in zong noute ahing nousiet hi. Tamte Pasian gam a dinga ka seppite laha teptan umsunte ahi ua, kei a dingin hamuonna ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Noute lah a mi, Jesu Khrist nasem khat Epaphras in noute mangpha ang hah hi; Pasian deilam chinteng a piching leh bukim a na dindet theina dingun, ama thungetna te ah theitawp suoin apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen aman noute a ding leh Laodisia leh Hierapolis khuo a umte dingin ahakat mama hi chi ka theipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Luk daktor ittah leh Dema in noute ahing nousiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laodisia khuo a unau umte leh Nimphas leh a inn a hattuomte mangpha ka hah hi hing na gen pieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam laihah noute laha na sim zou chiengun Laodisia hattuomte zong na simsah unlen, tuabangmain Laodisiate kunga laihah na sim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Arkippa kungah, “Mangpa a na mu nasepna khu na suhpiching theina ding in pilvangin,” na chi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei Paul in tam nousietna lai keima khut ngel a ka gel ahi, ka kolbute thei ngitnget un. Hepina na kung uah um hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
